"Breathe while charging" = "充电时呼吸";
"While the battery charges, the logo breathes like the old MacBook sleep light, then goes back to your effect." = "电池充电期间，标志会像旧款 MacBook 的睡眠指示灯一样呼吸，充完电后回到你选择的效果。";
"The logo glows with the sound your Mac is playing: brighter as it gets louder, peaking at your brightness. macOS asks once to let LogoLight hear it." = "标志随 Mac 正在播放的声音发光：声音越大越亮，峰值即你设定的亮度。macOS 会请求一次权限，允许 LogoLight 听到系统声音。";
