/* 错误 */
"The request was cancelled." = "请求已取消。";
"The command failed with exit code %d." = "命令执行失败，退出码 %d。";
"This Mac doesn't have an illuminated Apple logo. It requires a MacBook Pro with PROLED XDR Display." = "此 Mac 没有可发光的 Apple 标志，需要配备 PROLED XDR 显示屏的 MacBook Pro。";
"The setting was saved, but the logo didn't turn on." = "设置已保存，但标志没有打开。";
"The setting was saved, but the logo didn't turn off." = "设置已保存，但标志没有关闭。";
"Password-free toggling isn't available for the user name “%@”." = "用户名「%@」无法使用免密码切换。";
"The password-free rule was installed, but sudo isn't honoring it. Check /etc/sudoers for an #includedir line." = "免密码规则已安装，但 sudo 未遵循它。请检查 /etc/sudoers 中是否有 #includedir 行。";
"Following the sound needs macOS 14.2 or later." = "跟随声音需要 macOS 14.2 或更高版本。";
"LogoLight couldn't listen to the sound your Mac plays (Core Audio error %d). Allow LogoLight under System Audio Recording Only in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Screen & System Audio Recording." = "LogoLight 无法监听 Mac 播放的声音（Core Audio 错误 %d）。请在「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 屏幕与系统音频录制」中，于「仅系统音频录制」类别下允许 LogoLight。";

